//
// Intentionally no include guard. Define the inventory macros before including.
// Current RFC 0027 partitions: stable routing, headers, scope owners, binding
// targets, the module skeleton, lookup projections, stable owner-body records,
// fully specified owner-body descriptors, deterministic allocation, Binder
// result and diagnostic wires, active membership, readiness, canonical context
// inputs, stable materialization witnesses, and closed capability descriptors.

